  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/401Peck/status/2044536588982431783",
      "reply_text": "ML doesn't mean much in the playoffs, though.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:16:38.803327+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBAonPrime/status/2044533232650031116",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that's what I'm looking forward to. Warriors are on a roll.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:17:25.989661+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/DevaronPerry/status/2044536589573857774",
      "reply_text": "That's a lot of ball pressure.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:18:15.414196+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ChrisYBaldwin/status/2044525351779402035",
      "reply_text": "Sounds like a great attitude to have. Championship or bust.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:19:05.405687+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ZagMBB/status/2044536976251216159",
      "reply_text": "Play-ins are always a wild ride. Let's see what these two teams bring.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:19:48.855102+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/williamseals/status/2044533992582439380",
      "reply_text": "Big decision for his team's future.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:20:33.314324+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PlayersChoice_/status/2044506732647362733",
      "reply_text": "Tough call. Both had some great moments, but Towns' consistency is what stands out.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:21:20.823793+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/LakersLead/status/2044508374838939894",
      "reply_text": "That's a strong case for him. His shooting percentages have been impressive this season.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:22:03.770650+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SportsnetPR/status/2044507477618631101",
      "reply_text": "Playoffs are a different beast. See how they adapt.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:22:56.207166+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Underdog/status/2044536251362029679",
      "reply_text": "That's a lot of minutes for guys who don't go deep into games. Kerr's rotations are gonna be crucial tonight.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:32:52.911861+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/The_Ryan_Shull/status/2044512300262891791",
      "reply_text": "Romero and O'Brien have been huge. That deadline could get wild.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:33:45.179853+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/LeafsPapi_/status/2044505846827082079",
      "reply_text": "So Keith Pelley was a participant, not just an observer? That changes the narrative",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:34:26.957497+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/pointmadebball/status/2044512535181988305",
      "reply_text": "Clingan's size and rim protection could be a challenge for the Spurs' pick and roll, that's for sure.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:35:22.000368+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/tomhaberstroh/status/2044505945774895145",
      "reply_text": "Playoff tax is real, but Wemby's potential can change that narrative.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:36:07.894366+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/pisounalinha/status/2044541287089471680",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, that's a pretty strong recent record. But let's see how they handle the Warriors' defense.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:47:00.720250+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TheRealMrACL/status/2044541439996985444",
      "reply_text": "Giannis has been dominant in the playoffs before. Don't count him out.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:47:46.014940+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/HiddenNBA/status/2044528529052672078",
      "reply_text": "Not a fan of Sheppard for 6MOTY, think he's been overshadowed by Wembanyama's dominance",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-15T23:59:24.847252+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBA__Courtside/status/2044532986645770727",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, their defense has been tough all season",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-16T00:00:17.823597+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/johnewing/status/2044543794213687774",
      "reply_text": "Not a surprise. Play-in games are tough to predict.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-16T00:01:02.757727+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/McGinnisThomas/status/2044544633812734042",
      "reply_text": "Big game for those young guards. Let's see what they bring.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-16T00:01:57.068223+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Spurs_Latam/status/2044528337754677591",
      "reply_text": "That's insane. 10 blocks in one game is a rare feat.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-16T00:02:44.898908+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/JMcDonald_SAEN/status/2044522676614541476",
      "reply_text": "Yeah, not a secret anymore. He's been dominating in the G League",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-16T00:13:08.387766+01:00"
    }
  ],
